# YAML content rules

- These files MUST validate against the Zod schemas in `core/content-schema/src/index.ts`:
  - `concept-package.yaml` → `ConceptPackageSpec`
  - `SimulationSpec.yaml` → `SimulationSpec`
- Start from the canonical templates in `core/docs-templates/`. Do not invent fields.
- **Cross-references use exact filenames** from `docs/container-spec.md` §1. If you reference `concept-card.md`, write it `concept-card.md` — not `concept_card.md`, `ConceptCard.md`, etc.
- IDs are kebab-case and MUST match across:
  - directory name ↔ `concept-package.yaml.id`
  - sim subdirectory name ↔ `SimulationSpec.yaml.id` ↔ `concept-package.yaml.items.sims[].id`
  - transfer filename ↔ `concept-package.yaml.items.transfer_problems[].id`
- The validator hard-fails any divergence. Keep the manifest as the single source of truth and let other files defer to it.
- `kernel_deps` entries must resolve to existing `core/<kernel>/` directories.
